dialect protocol
protocol wires.spr
version 1
schema wires.mutation
start record
framing record
record reasoning.wires-add-node tag 1
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record reasoning.wires-wire-edge tag 2
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record reasoning.wires-patch-layout tag 3
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
chain hash u64
